OL,3,GNEWSAWill cash boost be enough to get
OL,4,Arough sleepers off streets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week, West Yorkshire Mayor
OL,7,FTracy Brabin pledged that almost #4m
OL,8,Fwould be used to help people sleeping
OL,9,Frough across the county, with Leeds and
OL,10,FBradford's councils set to get the
OL,11,Flargest amount - so how has that
OL,12,Fannouncement been received on the
OL,13,Fstreets of both those cities?
OL,15,FBegging outside a convenience store on
OL,16,FSunbridge Road in Bradford, Mark Green,
OL,17,F55, says he has been "in and out" of
OL,18,Fprison since 2011 and has been living
OL,19,Frough in Bradford for just under a
OL,20,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
