OL,3,GNEWSAWill cash boost be enough to get
OL,4,Arough sleepers off streets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith Bradford Council set to get
OL,7,F#688,194 from the mayor's office, with
OL,8,Fthe cash aimed at helping provide
OL,9,Faccommodation and targeted support to
OL,10,Fpeople with the most complex needs, he
OL,11,Fsays that will certainly help the
OL,12,Fsituation in the short-term.
OL,14,FHowever, in the longer term, Green says
OL,15,Fhe believes it will only prove to be a
OL,16,F"sticking plaster".
